<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花にこり.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Remember? The first time we met."<PG>
"<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"> showed up so suddenly that I threw on a Noh mask and rushed out on stage. You'd think I could have managed a better look."<PG>
"Haha, it feels like ages ago. <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"> and I spent a long time together, huh."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I'd been wishing for anyone at all to come..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花にこり.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I'm really glad it was <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"> who came here."<PG>
"I ran away into this world because it hurt, but I got to meet you in this world, and I'm truly glad I did."<PG>
"The time I spent here with you is my treasure."<PG>
"Well then... take care."<PG>
"I'm going where I belong."<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花にこり.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Thank you for coming here. <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"> is someone precious to me too."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\立木三日にこり.gal" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "600" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "立木三日" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Watch me. Over there, in that world, I'll definitely..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\立木三日発光.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Goodbye, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\立木三日発光おじぎ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "立木三日,111,雑談ゲージ,人物1" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
